spark-client (0.4.2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release 0.4.2.
  * Split release assets by platform and architecture: per-architecture
    Debian package tars, a flat all tar with both architectures' debs and
    the source package, and one Windows zip per architecture.
  * Ship the plugin SDK headers and stop building or packaging plugins here;
    each plugin is now a separate source package.

